    "audioStrategy": "Three offline recorded banks. Salamander C5 uses five recorded dynamics with crossfades between layers. Upright Piano KW uses two recorded dynamics. Rhodes Mark I uses one recorded dynamic, velocity-sensitive gain and filtering, and the author’s sustain loops at runtime. Nearby roots are transposed during playback. Clavinet, FM Stage Piano, Rosewood Marimba and the fallback are synthesized. All audio passes through per-layer effects and one master path.",
